<title>ESTONIA: HUVITUS TO PAY 11.18 PCT ON 3RD SERIES BONDS.</title>
<headline>HUVITUS TO PAY 11.18 PCT ON 3RD SERIES BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Huvitusfond's Third Series obligation fund will pay 11.18 percent interest on May 19, the fund said on Friday. </p>
<p>The interest is payable to those who are registered as owners with the central depository on May 15, the fund said in a statement.</p>
<p>The usual day for paying the interest is May 17, but as it is a holiday the interest will be paid on May 19.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
